{"track":"python","category":"딕셔너리","level":3,"title":"키와 값 뒤집기","desc":"<p>값이 모두 서로 다른 딕셔너리 <code>d</code>의 <b>키와 값을 뒤바꾼</b> 딕셔너리를 돌려주는 <code>invert(d)</code>를 만드세요. 예: <code>{\"a\": \"x\"}</code> → <code>{\"x\": \"a\"}</code></p>","starter":"def invert(d):\n    pass\n","solution":"def invert(d):\n    return {v: k for k, v in d.items()}\n","hint":"<p>딕셔너리 컴프리헨션: <code>{새키: 새값 for ... in d.items()}</code></p>","tests":[{"call":"invert({\"a\": \"x\", \"b\": \"y\"})","expected":{"x":"a","y":"b"},"visible":true},{"call":"invert({})","expected":{},"visible":true},{"call":"invert({\"k\": \"v\"})","expected":{"v":"k"},"visible":false},{"call":"invert({\"one\": \"uno\", \"two\": \"dos\"})","expected":{"uno":"one","dos":"two"},"visible":false}],"id":"py-064"}